{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《夫妻的博弈》昨晚（18日）劇情峰迴路轉！女主角高海寧（飾 Senna）慘成家族鬥爭的犧牲品，事業陷入前所未有的危機。正當未婚夫馬國明（飾 Aiden）都懷疑是陳曉華（飾 Quinn）從中作梗時，Quinn竟華麗轉身為Senna發聲，一句金句成功逆轉風向，更揭出幕後真正黑手！</p><p>高海寧廣告風波遭海嘯式負評</p><p>昨晚劇情講到，由Senna策劃的塑身衣廣告，竟被有心人惡意曲解成歧視女性，引發海嘯式負評，令Senna的事業及公司形象直插谷底。面對如此困境，連未婚夫Aiden都開始動搖，更一度懷疑事件的始作俑者就是他的前未婚妻、Senna的死敵Quinn，準備與她當面對質攤牌。</p><p>陳曉華金句反擊：要還佢哋一個公道</p><p>就在千鈞一髮之際，Quinn竟以優雅又強勢的姿態，公開為Senna及所有職場女性發聲，她的一段發言擲地有聲：「佢哋努力工作，但最後畀人曲解、用偏頗嘅眼光去針對傷害，我覺得佢哋先係被歧視嘅受害者，我覺得要還佢哋一個公道。」這番話不僅為Senna平反，更說出了無數職場女性的心聲，成功扭轉輿論劣勢。</p><p>網民激讚：呢段睇得好爽</p><p>Quinn的霸氣發言不但成功逆轉事件風向，更讓Aiden驚覺真正陷害Senna的幕後黑手，竟是自己的哥哥Titan（黃智賢飾）。這段劇情播出後，網民反應極為熱烈，大讚劇情精彩：「呢段睇得好爽！Quinn型到爆！」、「句對白寫得好好，完全講出好多職場女性心聲！」不少觀眾更對陳曉華的角色大為改觀：「估唔到係Quinn幫返Senna，劇情開始好睇！」、「陳曉華呢個角色好立體，唔係普通奸角。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_8517099976a85721ea77d3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01a_18150423186a8572280ea2c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_13659474506a85723b7838c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_5042212356a85723fefdfe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_19474514636a85724342c75.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_19722604916a857252f384d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_10994346666a8572605c470.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_13254184076a85727033d85.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08a_20746794766a857290dc575.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_18954372216a8572b16b807.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09a_17001720626a8572c3a0b51.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_17621638806a8572dcf0550.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_12471770486a8572e0a14f8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_6357871176a8572e483dc1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_5642537496a8572e82963a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_9535059396a85730a7c832.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_8184086236a85732d14028.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_15520905946a8573478375d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_5281905726a85735d3e183.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_9036848736a85737a9556d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_9540766376a8573cc4f35e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/upload